{quote}is there a plan in place for markets where the age verification is not mandatory?{quote}

There is no market where scooters don’t ask for age verification. There are different kinds of age verification - this ticket talks about self-declared age (so, not really verification). Not sure if I answerd your question. 

{quote}could the user opt out from providing such information (e.g. if the user provided date of birth in the rentals verification process, can they opt out from from repurposing this data for bolt + purposes?{quote}

They could ask for the date to be changed. But there wouldn’t really be a way to “clear” the date of birth in one place and not the other place.

{quote}would it be possible to add a privacy disclaimer to the screen where we could inform the user about additional/ secondary purposes of processing so we can deliver on the notification requirements? Also some amendments to our current privacy policy would be necessary here.{quote}

Yes, but it should be very short.

# *Contractor warehouse - could you please confirm which scenario/s will apply:*

* {color:#36b37e}the Contractor does not provide us with a warehouse (Bolt rents its own warehouse); or {color}
* {color:#36b37e}the Contractor provides us with a warehouse (that he separately leases) for our exclusive use and in return we repay the full amount of the rent to the Contractor; o{color}r
* the Contractor provides us with a warehouse (that he separately leases) but not for our exclusive use, so we repay to him only a proportional part of the rent.

{color:#36b37e}Scenarios in green apply.{color}

# Mechanics - will you also use some mechanics of the 3PL who will perform additional tasks and will you reimburse the salary of these mechanics employed by the 3PL(i.e. “X” EUR per month per mechanic)?

{color:#36b37e}Yes. The contractor employs mechanics and we pay them per month for this service.{color}

