Hey,

{quote}We do follow the “I did not receive a cancellation fee” global process in CS, the reason I raised the ticket is due to the ETA part that is not covered in that article.{quote}

By that article, do you mean _🚗 Driver reports cancellation fee or wait time fee was not charged?_ Could you clarify as checking ETA is covered there.

{quote}If a driver accidentally started a trip instead of pressing cancel, check that the driver waited for the minimum wait time. If yes, compensate the fee.{quote}

This will not be implemented globally and likely shouldn’t be implemented for NO either, the cancellation fee can be compensated if the ride was cancelled. We should not make it a rule to compensate driver mistakes.



